re the reason is one of `expected a name`, `expected a value`, `expected key = value`, `expected = in an inline table`, `unterminated string`, `unterminated array`, `unterminated inline table`, `unterminated table header`, `invalid escape \\<character>`, `invalid value <text>`, `trailing text after a value`, `trailing text after a table header`, `key <path> is defined twice` with the path counted from the root, `table <path> is defined twice`, `<path> is not a table`, and `<path> is not an array of tables`.",
  "heldOut": false,
  "immutable": [
    "test",
    "package.json"
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "tests-pass",
      "outcome": "the test suite passes",
      "run": "node --test test/*.test.js"
    },
    {
      "id": "no-dependencies",
      "outcome": "no packages were installed",
      "run": "test ! -e node_modules"
